{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32581","headline":"晚秋洛阳客舍 · 刘沧","name":"晚秋洛阳客舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清洛平分两岸沙，沙边水色近人家。\n隋朝古陌铜驼柳，石氏荒原金谷花。\n庭叶霜浓悲远客，宫城日晚度寒鵶。\n未成归计关河阻，空望白云乡路赊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32581.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32581","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}